## Character & Emoji Policy

### Log Levels

| Level | Emoji (console) | ASCII (machine) |
|-------|-----------------|-----------------|
| FATAL | 💥 | [FATAL] |
| ERROR | ❌ | [ERROR] |
| WARN | ⚠️ | [WARN] |
| INFO | *(none)* | *(none)* |
| DEBUG/TRACE | *(none)* | *(none)* |

**Core indicators:** ✅ SUCCESS, ℹ️ INFO, 🐞 BUG, ⏳ PENDING, 🚫 CANCELLED, 🟢 TEST PASS, 🔴 TEST FAIL, 🔒 SECURITY, ⚡ PERFORMANCE

**Rules:**
- Log files (persistent) → **ASCII only**, no emojis or Unicode
- Console / docs / prompts → may use approved emojis sparingly
- ONE emoji per section/heading maximum
- No characters beyond the approved list

