## Semantic Release

**Detection:** `.releaserc`, `release.config.*`, `VERSION` file.

### NEVER Do (semantic-release handles these)

- Edit `VERSION`, `CHANGELOG.md`, version in `package.json`/`pyproject.toml`/`Cargo.toml`
- Create git tags or GitHub releases
- Suggest version bumps in PRs

Local branch is usually 1 commit behind upstream after push (version commit). Run `git pull --rebase origin main` before every push.

