## Metrics

### Naming

- **Prometheus:** `{ns}_{domain}_{metric}_{unit}` with underscores. `_total` on ALL counters.
- **OTel:** `{ns}.{domain}.{metric}` with dots. Units in metadata.
- **Labels:** bounded cardinality (<100 values). NEVER use request IDs, IPs, or user strings.

### Standard Categories

| Purpose | Type | Pattern |
|---------|------|---------|
| Messages sent | counter | `{ns}_transport_sent_total` |
| Send errors | counter | `{ns}_transport_send_errors_total` |
| Queue depth | gauge | `{ns}_transport_queue_size` |
| Send latency | histogram | `{ns}_transport_send_duration_seconds` |
| Pipeline ready | gauge | `{ns}_pipeline_ready` (1/0) |

